configure
delete service snmp community techtrade-ro
set service snmp v3 engineid 000000000000000000000001
set service snmp v3 view all oid 1
set service snmp v3 group monitoring mode ro
set service snmp v3 group monitoring view all
set service snmp v3 user zbxmon group monitoring
set service snmp v3 user zbxmon auth type sha
set service snmp v3 user zbxmon auth plaintext-password TechTrade-Auth1
set service snmp v3 user zbxmon privacy type aes
set service snmp v3 user zbxmon privacy plaintext-password TechTrade-Priv1
commit
save
exit
